  "issue_comments": [
    {
      "body": "Hi @JustinTong0323 , could you please review #39261? \r\nIt fixes a silent streaming top_logprobs bug. I have also just updated the branch so it is current with main.\r\nThanks!",
      "created_at": "2026-09-22T09:36:35Z",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/39261#issuecomment-5774268694",
      "id": 5774268694,
      "updated_at": "2026-09-22T09:36:35Z",
      "user": {
        "login": "kushaldabbe"
      }
    },
    {
      "body": "Closing this as superseded by #41208 (merged Sep 25). \r\nI opened this PR on Sep 13 with the same fix: index `output_top_logprobs` by token position in both streaming and non-streaming, so every token in a multi-token chunk keeps its own alternatives. \r\n#41208 landed an equivalent change in `_build_token_logprobs_from_raw` (removing the `use_token_index` special case)",
      "created_at": "2026-10-24T05:24:58Z",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/39261#issuecomment-6380354717",
      "id": 6380354717,
      "updated_at": "2026-10-24T05:24:58Z",
      "user": {
        "login": "kushaldabbe"
      }
    }
